{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12244130","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12244130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1224413001:0":{"text":"シンドバッドさん、やっぱりここに！えっ、隣にいるのはベ……","source_cn":"辛巴达果然在这里！咦，旁边的不是贝——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37908517A7D89B6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224413002:1":{"text":"――しっ！静かに。まずは彼らの話を聞いてからよ。","source_cn":"——嘘！别出声，先听听他们在说什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x222AEAEDD5BD45B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224413003:0":{"text":"だからずっと前から、私の選択は正しかったと言ってるでしょ。","source_cn":"早就和你说过，我的选择才是正确的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x204C449E87F37BA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224413004:1":{"text":"いいか。もし俺がいなかったら、ブラッディ・マリーはテシオを捕まえることさえできてないんだぞ。","source_cn":"得了吧。要不是我，你们血薇帮也抓不到泰西欧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55BED76D5FCF68B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1224413005:1":{"text":"ふんっ、あんたが何をしたっていうのよ。隠し通路を見つけたこと、村人を救ったこと、カテーナ号に追いついたこと。あんた一人でやったとでも思ってるの？","source_cn":"哼，这件事和你有什么关系？发现密道的不是你，救出村里人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A56C863604B94F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docume